WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.240
One torn-out page lands on an exam desk.

2
00:00:03.290 --> 00:00:06.090
The rest of the book drifts into fog.

3
00:00:06.140 --> 00:00:08.000
A student stares at it.

4
00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:09.790
They've never read this novel.

5
00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:11.370
The clock starts.

6
00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:17.360
The page says: "the whole field was in
colour a desolate drab;" Whose field?

7
00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:18.590
Which story?

8
00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:22.330
No plot, no characters you
know, no book behind it.

9
00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:24.360
So where do you even start?

10
00:00:24.410 --> 00:00:27.510
In this mission, you'll ask
what one page can give you,

11
00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:28.810
and what it can't.

12
00:00:28.860 --> 00:00:30.270
Guess the rest of the plot?

13
00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:32.680
List every technique, fast?

14
00:00:32.730 --> 00:00:34.750
You'll find out where each one leads.

15
00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:39.380
And you'll build a routine, and test
it on Hardy's field against the clock.

16
00:00:39.430 --> 00:00:43.490
Your mission: work out where to
start with a page you've never seen.
